# Task: Codebase Audit & Modernization

## Objective
Perform a comprehensive analysis of the codebase to identify legacy code, unused artifacts, and modernization opportunities.

## Deep Scan
- [ ] Map entire file structure <!-- id: 0 -->
- [ ] **Legacy Patterns Search** <!-- id: 1 -->
    - [ ] `var` usage
    - [ ] CommonJS (`require`, `module.exports`)
    - [ ] Loose typing (`any`)
    - [ ] Legacy comments (`TODO`, `FIXME`, deprecated headers)
    - [ ] `console.log` overuse (should use Logger)
- [ ] **Architecture Review** <!-- id: 2 -->
    - [ ] `src/core` (Base classes, Dispatcher)
    - [ ] `src/foundation.ts` (Bootstrap logic)
    - [ ] `BO/` (Auth and potential others)
    - [ ] `scripts/` (Build and CLI tools)
- [ ] **Unused Code Detection** <!-- id: 3 -->
    - [ ] Orphaned files
    - [ ] Unused exports (via static analysis or sampling)

## Modernization Proposals
- [ ] Refactor opportunities (e.g., new TS features, better error handling)
- [ ] Performance optimizations
- [ ] Security improvements

## Deliverables
- [ ] `code_audit_report.md`
- [ ] Refactoring plan for identified issues
